<title>USA: Terra registers shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Terra registers shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY, Iowa 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Terra Industries Inc said Tuesday it filed a registration with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to issue three million shares of its stock in future acquisitions and similar deals.</p>
<p>The stock covered by the registration statement will not be sold to the public for cash, the company said.</p>
<p>&quot;Terra has no immediate plans to use this stock,&quot; said Burton Joyce, Terra's president and chief executive. &quot;However, its availability will provide the company flexibility in the future when stock is an appropriate mechanism for completing a transaction.&quot;</p>
<p>Terra is a marketer and producer of nitrogen fertilizer, crop protection products, seed and services for agricultural, turf, ornamental and other growers.</p>
<p>((-- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
